@startuml
title MW-06 - AI Schedule Proposal and Approval

start
:Click "Propose schedule";

:Filter the eligible tasks;
note right
  Only flexible tasks,
  no fixed time,
  no slot yet,
  not completed.
end note

if (Any eligible task?) then (No)
  :Notify that there is nothing to schedule;
  stop
endif

:Request a schedule proposal for each task;
:Receive the proposed slots and warnings for each task;

if (Enough free time for this task?) then (Yes)
  :Display the proposed time slots;
else (No)
  :Display why there is not enough room;
  :Display the missing minutes;
  :Skip this task;
endif

:Tick or untick the individual slots;
:Click "Add to calendar";

:Write each approved slot to the calendar;

if (Any slot failed?) then (Yes)
  :Untick the failed slots;
  :Keep the proposal open for re-approval;
else (No)
  :Notify how many slots were added;
  :Refresh the calendar;
endif

stop
@enduml
